            "notes": "For round 2, we will take [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) and [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8). Both these abilities boost attack speed and  [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) gives us 10% more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal), giving us more sustain. [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is a staple of the early rounds as it gives a big [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) boost, which helps 1v1 other tanks and compliments our high [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal).\n\nWe will also be holding onto our Round 1 items, but if you can't afford it, I recommend selling [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) rather than the other two green items we have, as the two rare items we just got already boost  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).\n\n---\n\n**OPTIONAL ITEMS FOR REST OF MATCH:**\n\nIf you are facing a [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) or [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000), [Crusader\u2019s Cure](item_e89b853c-2441-432b-b4eb-20bc4b1b0619) can be a great choice to cleanse anti. This will be viable for the rest of the match, though I won't bring it up again in this guide. Remember though, this isn't necessary. Only go with this if you notice anti being an issue, and feel free to sell at any time.\n\nIf Sleep Darts from [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or Flashbangs from [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b) are annoying you, [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) is a good choice to mitigate their effects.\n\nIf you cannot afford [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8), [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is a viable pick to boost [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).",
