            "notes": "Round 3 we will take [Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399) as our second power. This compliments the build nicely because of our boosted  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed). After all, more swingin'; more burnin'. The extra burn damage will be useful for getting a bit extra damage and cash.\n\nFor our next item, [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is a must. This boosts survivability, [Move Speed](stat_move_speed), and [Melee Damage](stat_melee_damage). So every swing you land will make you that much stronger.\n\nOn this round, you should start noticing just how easy tank 1v1s will be. This is around the time you'll want to start playing a bit more aggressive.",
